    # mc "I think we found our lead suspect."
    mc "我觉得我们找到主要嫌疑了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_three/chapter_three_scene_seventeen.rpy:1585
translate schinese house_one_barrel_label_65a9eb4b:

    # na "So what do we do, detective?"
    na "那我们怎么办，警探？"

# game/chapters/chapter_three/chapter_three_scene_seventeen.rpy:1588
translate schinese house_one_barrel_label_7b458699:

    # mc "We have to find something to cure this kid…"
    mc "我们得找到能治这孩子的东西……"

# game/chapters/chapter_three/chapter_three_scene_seventeen.rpy:1589
translate schinese house_one_barrel_label_b1c56dd6:

    # mc "Maybe an herb or something."
    mc "也许是某种草药。"

# game/chapters/chapter_three/chapter_three_scene_seventeen.rpy:1591
